\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {39}{\ignorespaces Reconstructed-level comparison, events per truth event: the open dataset's reconstruction of the GENIE events, the surrogate on the same GENIE events, and the surrogate on the NuWro events. Lower panels: surrogate on GENIE over open dataset (closure) and surrogate on NuWro over surrogate on GENIE (generator difference). The first bin of the two calorimetric quantities holds the exact zeros.}}{44}{figure.39}%
